        "Content": "LEONARD WILSON KEENAN ESTATE & LETTING AGENTS\r\nOur business is you….\r\n\r\nEXTRA SPACIOUS 2 BED / 2 BATH OWN DOOR HOME\r\nPRIVATE GARDEN / TERRACE\r\nWONDERFUL SETTING ADJACENT TO BEAUTIFUL GREEN\r\nDESIGNATED & VISITOR PARKING\r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING STRONGLY ADVISED\r\nEXCELLENT RENTAL YIELD GENERATING EXCESS OF €25,000 PER ANNUM\r\n\r\nA must view property….\r\n\r\nSitting tenant in place - Investor only sale. An owner occupier / first time buyer cannot purchase this property.\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Patrick Leonard The Finglas Property Specialists are truly delighted to present this lovely 2 bed / 2 bath garden level home to the Dublin 11 property market.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation consists of: Entrance hall, living / dining room, kitchen, inner hall, store room, 2 double bedrooms to include primary en suite and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe many features of this home include: Modern shaker style fitted kitchen offering an abundance of base and eye level storage to include all integrated appliances, doors from bedroom leading to private garden area, fitted wardrobes in both bedrooms and quality tiling & white sanitary ware in both bathrooms. The property further boasts double glazed windows and gas fired central heating system with energy efficient boiler.\r\n\r\nThere is designated parking in addition to visitor parking.\r\n\r\nHampton Wood is a most sought after development of homes adjacent to a host of local amenities to include Finglas Village, excellent catchment for both primary and secondary schools, parks and recreational facilities. There is a large Centra Store within the development itself. Furthermore The Charlestown Shopping Centre to include the Odeon Cinema together with IKEA are quite literally on your doorstep. DCU is also within close proximity. There is an excellent bus service offering a QBC to The City Centre. The M50 is also within close reach making this a most strategically positioned home.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised. \r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
